\section{Canonical TSSE Control Kernel (TSSE-CK)}

Define the TSSE Control Kernel:
\[
\mathcal{K}_{\text{TSSE-CK}} =
\left(
\mathcal{C}(t),\;
\mathcal{C}_{\mathcal{S}}(t),\;
\mathcal{C}_{\mathcal{T}}(t),\;
H_{\text{TSSE–AITFE}},\;
\mathcal{S}_{\text{TSSE–AITFE}},\;
\mathcal{T},\;
\mathcal{U}(t)
\right).
\]

It enforces:
\[
\mathcal{C}(t)\mathcal{U}(t) = \mathcal{U}(t)\mathcal{C}(t),
\qquad
\mathcal{C}_{\mathcal{S}}(t)(q,p) \in \mathcal{S}_{\text{TSSE–AITFE}},
\qquad
\mathcal{C}_{\mathcal{T}}(t)\mathcal{T} = \mathcal{T}\mathcal{C}_{\mathcal{T}}(t),
\]
\[
\mathcal{C}(t)^\top J\,\mathcal{C}(t) = J.
\]

This kernel defines the complete autonomous control architecture of TSSE engines.

